      "title": "Handler reads a route param that does not exist",
      "description": "The route at src/routes/users.js:7 declares the param as :id. The handler destructures userId from req.params, so userId is always undefined. findUser(undefined) always returns nothing, so GET /users/:id answers 404 for every user. The error message also says \"no user with id undefined\". Read the id param that the route declares.",
